  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "000000000001",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000000",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "Al elegir un resort familiar en Egipto, la primera decisión no es el nombre del hotel. Es el tipo de viaje: descansar junto al mar, enseñar arrecifes, ver pirámides y museos, o caminar templos con niños que ya pueden entender lo que están mirando."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000003",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000002",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egipto puede funcionar muy bien para familias, pero no de una sola manera."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000005",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000004",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Hay tres viajes familiares bastante distintos."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000007",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "37tam5ucsn2u",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Uno es el viaje de descanso en el mar Rojo: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k6dltacct86l",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "o9odn0yjvoeu"
          ],
          "text": "Hurghada"
        },
        {
          "_key": "qxqlp9qqbpa5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", Makadi Bay, Sahl Hasheesh o "
        },
        {
          "_key": "agk6rbumibby",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "xzhje8tcmrqb"
          ],
          "text": "Marsa Alam"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4c5n9828nrgz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Otro es el viaje de playa y snorkel en Sharm el-Sheikh, en el Sinaí. El tercero es el viaje histórico: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "v99r5nnyvn6u",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "qwb2hoirjusx"
          ],
          "text": "El Cairo"
        },
        {
          "_key": "aprifxvthr25",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "x787k0ql0tx6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "6svt4n8zdhiu"
          ],
          "text": "Guiza"
        },
        {
          "_key": "skoclp2acupy",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "e3zda6uryidp",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "r6oceqqvrxsf"
          ],
          "text": "Luxor"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ectuasa9xkr4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " y, si hay más tiempo, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "dpnmr91xrsyx",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "ul2udayxy4ls"
          ],
          "text": "Asuán"
        },
        {
          "_key": "vt8d7iffo4kz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "o9odn0yjvoeu",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "xzhje8tcmrqb",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58885",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "qwb2hoirjusx",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "6svt4n8zdhiu",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58854",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "r6oceqqvrxsf",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
